774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z" data-astro-cid-ukdvzj5u></path></svg>  </a><a class="social-share-btn" target="_blank" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https://datacrunch.io/blog/takomo-sunset&text=Takomo.ai is retired from service. Learn about our transition to Serverless Containers for more scalable, efficient AI workloads.&via=DataCrunch_io" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-astro-cid-72xltosi>   <svg role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-astro-cid-72xltosi><title>X</title><path d="M18.901 1.153h3.68l-8.04 9.19L24 22.846h-7.406l-5.8-7.584-6.638 7.584H.474l8.6-9.83L0 1.154h7.594l5.243 6.932ZM17.61 20.644h2.039L6.486 3.24H4.298Z" data-astro-cid-72xltosi></path></svg>  </a><a class="social-share-btn" target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://datacrunch.io/blog/takomo-sunset" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-astro-cid-tfirz3t4>   <svg role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-astro-cid-tfirz3t4><title>Facebook</title><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z" data-astro-cid-tfirz3t4></path></svg>  </a> </div> </div> </div> <img src="/_image?href=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fx2olw4gi7mbv%2F1tyTRosvvjOpazpI1fv9OH%2Fa2fbd02c2793096a0d4d42a8544b15a1%2FTakomo_Sunset.png&#38;w=720&#38;h=377&#38;f=webp" srcset="/_image?href=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fx2olw4gi7mbv%2F1tyTRosvvjOpazpI1fv9OH%2Fa2fbd02c2793096a0d4d42a8544b15a1%2FTakomo_Sunset.png&#38;w=720&#38;h=377&#38;f=webp 1x, /_image?href=https%3A%2F%2Fimages.ctfassets.net%2Fx2olw4gi7mbv%2F1tyTRosvvjOpazpI1fv9OH%2Fa2fbd02c2793096a0d4d42a8544b15a1%2FTakomo_Sunset.png&#38;w=1440&#38;f=webp 2x" class="hYZFkb cmpEQN eqVYUc bTseUd cyRvJI" alt="Takomo Sunset" loading="eager" width="720" height="377" decoding="async"> <article id="blog-content-content"><p>Takomo - our no-code builder for combining and running AI models with ease - is officially retired. We’re shifting our focus to <b>Serverless Containers</b> to help you deploy and scale containerized workloads with greater efficiency and flexibility.</p><p><b>What was Takomo?</b></p><p>Takomo was a platform designed to make AI model integration simple, powerful, and accessible. Over the past two years Takomo has allowed users to link AI models together effortlessly in one pipeline.</p><p>For example, imagine you wanted to transcribe an audio file using an ASR (Automatic Speech Recognition) model, summarize the transcript with a language model like GPT, and then generate an email draft based on the summary. With Takomo, you could chain these models into a seamless workflow, enabling them to interact and pass data to one another.</p><p><b>Why the Change?</b></p><p>The Takomo developer community showed great creativity, integrating tools like natural language processing and image recognition to create totally original new AI applications. However, as AI workflows have grown more complex, we believe that Serverless Containers will better serve your needs by offering scalable, cost-efficient, and powerful infrastructure to support your projects.</p><p><b>Introducing Serverless Containers</b></p><p>Our new Serverless Containers service is purpose-built for scaling up AI and machine learning workloads. It offers:</p><ul><li><p><b>Scalability:</b> Automatically adjust resources to match workload demands.</p></li><li><p><b>Cost efficiency:</b> Only pay for the compute you use.</p></li><li><p><b>Simplified deployment:</b> Reduce infrastructure complexity with easy container deployment.</p></li></ul><p>As we prepare to launch Serverless Containers, we invite you to join the waitlist to be among the first to experience the service.</p><p>👉 <a href="https://form.typeform.com/to/etCSFcOH">Sign Up Here</a></p><p><b>Thank You, Takomo Community</b></p><p>It’s with a heavy heart that we retire Takomo - and thank everyone who actively tested and deployed models on the service.</p><p>Your creativity and innovation with Takomo have shaped our journey and inspired this next step. We’re deeply grateful for your support and look forward to continuing to empower your AI projects with even better tools.</p></article> </main>  <footer class="fPSBzf kSmiQp dKLBtz iLbQFp hYZFkb chSUPu"> <div class="fPSBzf kSmiQp gfRcrW iLbQFp hYZFkb kRzbzr dnRKCj jwemEO eaomNi gzLAZt"> <div class="fPSBzf kSmiQp hYZFkb iLbQFp gaoMZG gzLAZt hekKpV jKmOOw idvbgE"> <h2 class="kdFIjO cFGrCm mMBDP iXHYXK">Start your ML journey today</h2> <div class="fPSBzf kSmiQp coXRbg ksWBqx"> <a class="fEVEmD kSmiQp legDhJ dlDteq jTWvec bZRhvx bGySga cHjsHT gNnTtK jwcOgk fNyeNb esTyyJ gGTyfw AFMPC BKYtN hZMpCq hkuMfQ dcFfgD" href="https://cloud.datacrunch.io/signup" target="_blank">
